---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for AmazingPlugins: what data this website and our free WooCommerce plugins collect, how it is used, and how to contact us about it.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <h2>What We Collect</h2>
      <p>The WooCommerce Accessibility Fixer plugin collects <strong>anonymous usage statistics</strong> to improve the plugin  --  which fixers are run most, WooCommerce version, and error reports. No personal data, no product data, no URLs.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use <strong>Resend</strong> for transactional emails (if you contact support) and <strong>WordPress.org</strong> for plugin distribution. Their privacy policies apply.</p>

      <h2>Contact verification</h2>
      <p>Our contact page uses Cloudflare Turnstile to reduce automated email harvesting. Cloudflare processes browser and network signals to perform this check. We verify the result before showing a contact address. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a> for details.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website uses no tracking cookies. The plugin uses no cookies.</p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain anonymous usage data for up to 12 months. You can request deletion of any data associated with your email through <a href="/contact/#general">our contact page</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy concerns: <a href="/contact/#general">our contact page</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .prose h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
</style>
